## Original Content
Apple’s Mac Mini and Mac Studio have been tough to buy for months, but updated versions have arrived. Both include new chips optimized for AI, with the M6 Mac Mini getting a $200 price bump.

## Summary
Apple has released updated versions of the Mac Mini and Mac Studio featuring new M6 and M5 Ultra chips optimized for AI. The M6 Mac Mini comes with a $200 price increase, and both models have been in short supply for months.

## Key Points
- Apple launched new Mac Mini and Mac Studio models.
- The chips, M6 and M5 Ultra, are designed for AI performance.
- The M6 Mac Mini has a $200 price bump.
- Both products faced supply issues prior to the update.


